{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43116","headline":"九日对酒 · 元凛","name":"九日对酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉辰复遇登高台，良朋笑语倾金罍。\n烟摊秋色正堪翫，风惹菊香无限来。\n未保乱离今日後，且谋欢洽玉山颓。\n谁知靖节当时事，空学狂歌倒载回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元凛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}